    {
      "subject": "captain Snegiryov",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Ilusha",
      "quote": "His father was terribly concerned about him. He even gave up drinking and was almost crazy with terror that his boy would die.",
      "disputed": false,
